# CloudFormation in DevOps

CloudFormation becomes much more powerful when combined with CI/CD.

For example:

```text
Developer
    ↓
Git Push
    ↓
GitHub
    ↓
GitHub Actions
    ↓
CloudFormation
    ↓
AWS Infrastructure
```

Suppose I store:

```text
infrastructure/
    └── template.yaml
```

in GitHub.

Whenever infrastructure changes:

```text
Developer
    ↓
Modify template
    ↓
Git commit
    ↓
Git push
    ↓
GitHub Actions
    ↓
CloudFormation
    ↓
Update infrastructure
```

This gives us **version-controlled infrastructure**.

---

