# Key Benefits of CloudFormation

### 1. Infrastructure as Code

Infrastructure is defined using templates.

### 2. Automation

Resources can be created and updated automatically.

### 3. Reproducibility

The same infrastructure can be recreated from the template.

### 4. Version Control

Templates can be stored in Git.

### 5. Consistency

Dev, staging, and production environments can follow the same infrastructure definition.

### 6. Dependency Management

CloudFormation understands relationships between resources.

### 7. Rollback

Failed stack operations can be rolled back.

### 8. Drift Detection

CloudFormation can identify configuration differences between supported resources and the expected template configuration.

