 ├── Private Subnets
 ├── Security Groups
 ├── ALB
 ├── EC2
 └── S3
```

Instead of manually creating everything:

```text
AWS Console
 ↓
Create VPC
 ↓
Create Subnets
 ↓
Create Security Groups
 ↓
Create ALB
 ↓
Create EC2
 ↓
Create S3
```

They create:

```text
infrastructure.yaml
```

and CloudFormation provisions the infrastructure.

```text
infrastructure.yaml
        ↓
CloudFormation Stack
        ↓
AWS Infrastructure
```

If the company needs another environment:

```text
